{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03043",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.52,
      "end_seconds": 4.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.76,
      "end_seconds": 9.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 10.77,
      "end_seconds": 22.81,
      "duration_seconds": 12.04,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay. It's headaches most days, doctor. He didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.04,
      "end_seconds": 26.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 28.29,
      "end_seconds": 38.3,
      "duration_seconds": 10.01,
      "text": "He is on propranolol, 40 milligrams, twice a day for the migraine prevention, I give it to him."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.85,
      "end_seconds": 45.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 46.51,
      "end_seconds": 47.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "For six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.42,
      "end_seconds": 49.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Hm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 51.13,
      "end_seconds": 62.83,
      "duration_seconds": 11.7,
      "text": "He takes Asthalin inhaler, when needed for my asthma. He is on escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day for the anxiety, I give it to him."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.54,
      "end_seconds": 70.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.69,
      "end_seconds": 84.43,
      "duration_seconds": 12.74,
      "text": "It's been two months now. Oh, and taking painkillers every day. Had that since Monday. So, and I've been feeling sick as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.37,
      "end_seconds": 88.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Has there been light sensitivity too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.76,
      "end_seconds": 93.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Mm, uh, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.23,
      "end_seconds": 98.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Any stiff neck or fever at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.06,
      "end_seconds": 102.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "No stiff neck or fever, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.53,
      "end_seconds": 106.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Any visual changes or weakness at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.4,
      "end_seconds": 112.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, no, no visual changes or weakness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.22,
      "end_seconds": 117.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.68,
      "end_seconds": 123.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Let me think, nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.23,
      "end_seconds": 128.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.1,
      "end_seconds": 142.7,
      "duration_seconds": 13.6,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.36,
      "end_seconds": 148.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.2,
      "end_seconds": 165.43,
      "duration_seconds": 15.23,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. No, I've never smoked in my life. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.0,
      "end_seconds": 168.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.63,
      "end_seconds": 179.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "Just my appendix taken out, when I was in my twenties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.78,
      "end_seconds": 194.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "So, do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.05,
      "end_seconds": 212.98,
      "duration_seconds": 17.93,
      "text": "Erm, I've got migraines. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me. I did try to ignore it for a while. I've had asthma for about a year now. I've had anxiety for about ten years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.48,
      "end_seconds": 219.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Alright, migraines and asthma, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 234.7,
      "end_seconds": 243.92,
      "duration_seconds": 9.22,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Oxygen saturation is 97 percent, blood pressure 125 over 80, pulse 65, respiratory rate 18."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.22,
      "end_seconds": 245.92,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.33,
      "end_seconds": 251.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.19,
      "end_seconds": 254.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.38,
      "end_seconds": 273.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Your neurological examination is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.06,
      "end_seconds": 278.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.05,
      "end_seconds": 297.05,
      "duration_seconds": 11.0,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, my working impression is medication-overuse headache on a background of migraine. We shouldn't forget tension-type headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.09,
      "end_seconds": 300.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.58,
      "end_seconds": 315.97,
      "duration_seconds": 14.39,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like medication-overuse headache on a background of migraine. I'm prescribing amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, long term. It's for headache prevention."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.11,
      "end_seconds": 320.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Fine, uh, I'll begin it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.31,
      "end_seconds": 326.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Right, I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.61,
      "end_seconds": 330.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Alright, uh, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.75,
      "end_seconds": 333.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}